# Toolchain

Purpose:
  Maintain current, supported versions of Node, pnpm, and Go.
  CI scans this spec on every run and creates tasks on violation.

Owns:
  /.nvmrc
  /DO/Dockerfile
  /DO/ci-cd/*.yml

## Version Registry

Versions:
  node: {version from .nvmrc}
  pnpm: {version from package.json or CI config}
  go: {version from go.mod}
  docker_base: {image:tag from DO/Dockerfile}

## Requirements

Must:
  CI-used Node/pnpm version is not EOL.
  Go version is supported by the project.
  Docker base image is maintained.

## CI Integration

CI_Scan:
  Trigger: Every CI run
  Action:
    - Read versions from owned files
    - Compare against this spec
    - IF violation:
        → Auto-create new [ ] task in this spec
        → Notify operator
    - IF compliant:
        → No action

## Tasks

Tasks:
  [ ] #1 Verify Node version is not EOL
  [ ] #2 Verify pnpm version is not EOL
  [ ] #3 Verify Go version is supported

Created_At: <timestamp>
Updated_At: <timestamp>

State: +
